Package: panpathAudit
Type: Package
Title: Audit Sequence Preservation in GFA Traversals
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Anestis",
             family = "Gkanogiannis",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "anestis@gkanogiannis.com",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6441-0688"))
    )
Description: Audits source FASTA sequences against named paths and
    coordinate-aware walks in GFA files. It reports exact recovery,
    divergence coordinates, digests, and optional base-level statistics.
    Graph topology is not validated.
